# CASM Phase 13 WP81 trusted reference: casmfill1
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmfill1 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves
# .FILL's required two-operand grammar produces correct bytes through the
# real production parser/emitter (parser.s's ppsFillDirective, emit.s's
# emitFill/emitFillLoop).
#
# Source (.ORG $C000, fixed address -- no relocatable symbols involved):
#   .ORG $C000
#   .FILL 4,$40   ; 4 bytes, each $40
#
# Hand assembly:
#   00 C0        PRG load-address header ($C000, little-endian)
#   40 40 40 40  .FILL 4,$40
#
# bytes: 6

00 C0
40 40 40 40
